FirstMetHimayo: {
	SpeakerName: Himura Mayo
	Line1: ...I'm still alive?
	Line2: Wait, let me make sure... Is this some kind of spirit summoning?
	Line3: No...
	Line4: Why is my consciousness inside a sword now?
	Line5: My head is spinning... I can't wrap my head around what's happening at all.
	Line6: Still, since the blade is in your hands...
	Line7: From today onward, please take good care of me!
}

ToriiShrine: {
	InteractHint: "[Right Click] Draw the blade"
	SealedHint: "[Right Click] Grip the hilt"
	InventoryFullHint: Inventory is full. Clear a slot before drawing the blade
}

ItCametoThis: {
	Line1: Really didn't want it to come to this
	Line2: From now on, this world is in my hands
}

HimayoEyeOfCthulhuGift: {
	L0: Whew... it's finally down. Being stared down by an eyeball that big for half the night gave me chills
	L1: But staring like that without blinking once, doesn't it get tired of its own eyes aching?
	L2: Stared at for so long, I was starting to doze off myself
	L3: Here, fished out a little something nearby, hold on to it, don't drop it
	L4: Take a breather, tonight we can finally close our eyes and get some real sleep
}

HimayoEvilBossGift: {
	L0Worm: Those chunks jammed in the mud, the stench is like a ditch freshly dug up, suffocating me in here
	L1Worm: Shake the blade clean and sheath it, let's find some breezy spot to air out
	L0Brain: Soggy and exposed, makes my skin crawl just looking at it, brains belong tucked inside a skull
	L1Brain: The blade is all sticky, wipe it down with a rag, and don't wipe it on your clothes
}

HimayoCalamityEvilGift: {
	L0: That messy clump piled up earlier... looked an awful lot like smashed red bean paste
	L1: Ahem, didn't think much of it before, but saying it out loud made me hungry
	L2: If you're hungry too go find some food, toughing it out right after a fight is the dumbest move
	L3: Grabbed a little curio while I was at it, here, take it
	L4: And don't rub the grime on your face, it'll sting your eyes, trust me on this
}

HimayoSlimeGodGift: {
	L0: Sticky, sure, but after wading through enough mud, this puddle of divine paste isn't too bad
	L1: At least it didn't seep down the trouser legs into our boots, quite divine of it, really
	L2: Scooped this out of the jelly pile, take it, and don't ask where I found it
}

HimayoWallOfFleshGift: {
	L0: ...It really broke, that whole wall of flesh collapsed
	L1: How should I put it, the air shifted all at once, and even the edge inside feels a notch heavier
	L2: The road ahead is going to be a lot rougher... Still, hold the blade tight, I'm right here with you
}

HimayoFesterSerpentGift: {
	L0: Hold on, what scraped onto the edge this time, yellow sand and pus? What a bizarre stench
	L1: I live inside here without a single window, it's practically a mud puddle now
	L2: Leave me some clean air, there's really no room to air out in here
	L3: Pick something cleaner next time, even a hard-shelled crab beats a giant festering worm
}

HimayoBrimstoneElementalGift: {
	L0: The lava shoals around are still sputtering white smoke, stand here any longer and our soles will cook
	L1: Stop staring at the sparks, watch out or you'll burn a hole right through your boots
	L2: The edge is still hot to the touch, hang it by your hip to cool off, let's head somewhere cooler
}

HimayoDestroyerGift: {
	L0: Made such an earth-shattering racket, but crack it open and it's really just a long string of solid iron wheels
	L1: Shook my head so hard it's still buzzing right now
	L2: Pulled a sturdy piece from the iron core, hold tight, if it drops and crushes your foot, I'm not carrying you
}

HimayoTwinsGift: {
	L0: One red and one green, darting across the sky with eyes bulging like copper bells
	L1: Halfway through I kept wondering: if they crashed into each other, would they make each other dizzy?
	L2: Back then I used to play staring contests with people, and I lost every single time
	L3: Pfft... just imagining the two of them bumping heads makes me want to laugh
}

HimayoSkeletronPrimeGift: {
	L0: An ancient skull on top, but fitted with four brand-new giant iron saws underneath
	L1: Like someone pulled on half an outfit and rushed out the door to brawl, awkward to even look at
	L2: The skeleton's completely scattered, while those iron arms are still warm, see if there's anything handy
}

HimayoCalamitasCloneGift: {
	L0: Whew... finally dispersed, that figure floating in the air moved as stiffly as a puppet on strings
	L1: The harder it tried to mimic a living person, the faker and stiffer it felt, creepy just watching it
	L2: A rubbing dropped from the ashes, take it, this one's definitely real
}

HimayoPlanteraGift: {
	L0: Whew, the vines finally withered away, stinks of rotten roots and sour soil
	L1: Back home we always said: once a flower rots at the core, pull it up by the roots no matter how pretty it was, or the whole bed is ruined
	L2: Dead stems rotting in the dirt are an eyesore anyway, just clutter, annoying to look at
	L3: Brush the petal scraps and crushed buds off the blade, tidy up and let's get going
}

HimayoGolemGift: {
	L0: Do your wrists ache? Rub them quick, that big stone pillar was rock-solid, swinging into it jars right up the arms
	L1: The edge nearly notched against it, sitting inside felt like an earthquake
	L2: When dealing with hard rocks like that, look for seams, don't go hacking edge-first like an honest fool
	L3: If you chip the blade I won't let you hear the end of it, sit down and catch your breath
}

HimayoCultistGift: {
	L0: Whew... the dungeon door is finally dead quiet
	L1: That circle muttering on and on without stopping made my ears throb, irritating beyond belief
}

HimayoMoonLordGift: {
	L0: That massive gray shadow over the sky... it's finally cleared away completely
	L1: The heaviness pressing down for so long suddenly vanished, the moonlight coming down leaves you dazed for a second
	L2: Still on your feet? Getting this far wasn't easy, tonight you've earned a solid night's sleep
}

HimayoProvidenceGift: {
	L0: Sss... heatwave hasn't faded, the backs of our hands are baked red
	L1: Standing here feels like squatting by a fresh-fired kiln roasting sweet potatoes, even hair tips feel scorched
	L2: Picked out the hot rubbing for you already, hold tight and let's pull back, find some water to cool off
}

HimayoPolterghastGift: {
	L0: The draft down here chills right to the bone, like damp laundry hung in a dark room for half a month
	L1: Not a single window to air out, no firewood for a brazier, sleep here and tomorrow your lower back will ache for sure
	L2: The vengeful souls are all swept flat, but the cold air is still creeping into our clothes
	L3: Don't linger in this damp pit, head back up to a campfire so we don't catch a deep chill
}

HimayoDevourerOfGodsGift: {
	L0: When that massive body rolled out of the void earlier... it really looked like someone took a bite right out of the sky
	L1: Staring down into that bottomless black maw, I spaced out for a second myself
	L2: Snap out of it, seeing you whole and sound without missing an arm or a leg, that's what puts my heart at ease
}

HimayoYharonGift: {
	L0: The blade is glowing red-hot, inside here feels like being shoved into a blacksmith's forge
	L1: Don't sheath it in a hurry, or I'll end up as a roasted sword spirit
	L2: Hang it loose to catch the wind and cool down, whew... that overgrown moth had terrifying muscle
	L3: Left the rubbing aside for now, take a look once it's properly cooled off
}

HimayoExoMechsGift: {
	L0: Clatter and crash finally sputtered out, the artillery bombardment earlier has my ears ringing even now
	L1: Exactly like someone tapping away inside my skull with a little hammer, annoying to death
	L2: Let's get away from all this scorched iron stench and find a quiet valley to catch our breath
}

HimayoSupremeCalamitasGift: {
	L0: The barrier shattered... that suffocating ash and crushing pressure finally drifted apart
	L1: Don't stand frozen in the draft, take a deep breath, or splash some cold water on your face to wake up
	L2: Back when I handled malevolent spirits, life-or-death scrapes like this were nothing new... But this time, I had you beside me
}

HimayoBossRushGift: {
	L0: Stand still for a second... legs wobbling, aren't they?
	L1: Catch your breath slow and steady... You fought through the whole long road, welcome back
}
